WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.836
In the year 626, the Prince of Qin, Li Shimin, had won great military glory, yet his conflict with Crown Prince Li Jiancheng and Prince Li Yuanji deepened by the day.

00:00:12.186 --> 00:00:18.402
The brothers suspected one another, and Li Jiancheng and Li Yuanji tried many times to get rid of Li Shimin.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:22.832
They lowered their voices, looking very uneasy.

00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:29.398
At dawn on the fourth day of the sixth month, Li Shimin led his trusted generals and lay in wait at the Xuanwu Gate in Chang'an.

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:33.948
Before the sky had lightened, everyone held their breath and waited.

00:00:34.298 --> 00:00:40.898
The Crown Prince and the Prince of Qi rode into the palace. Li Shimin acted decisively, and the coup succeeded at one stroke.

00:00:41.248 --> 00:00:45.544
The guards opened the palace gate and stepped to either side.

00:00:45.894 --> 00:00:50.286
Emperor Gaozu of Tang, having no other choice, made Li Shimin the crown prince.

00:00:50.636 --> 00:00:57.596
Two months later, Li Shimin formally ascended the throne as Emperor Taizong of Tang, and began the Zhenguan Reign.

00:00:57.946 --> 00:01:01.666
The officials offered their congratulations in unison, and a new era began.

